-- words --
Reading: clone A ran one Hypothesis of an open Goal; in a fresh clone B, `hyp status G` prints `runs: 0 of 3 used`.
-- run --
hyp status "$G"; echo "A: $(cd "$CLONE_A" && hyp status "$G" | head -n 1)"
-- floor: contains --
G  open  runs: 0 of 3 used
-- floor: contains --
A: G  open  runs: 1 of 3 used
